,2001,53,121,27]],"links":[["Liberty County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/montana/liberty-county"],["ARC or PLC in Liberty County","/arc-plc/montana/liberty-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids, August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, September to October ran 48% of normal on the middle, while January to February came in at 201%. Grid 34276 had its driest year in 1973 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
